# Deny by default, then name exactly what the image needs. The deprecated
# harness is absent from this allowlist on purpose: it keeps the decoupling
# honest, since a COPY that reached back into it would fail the build rather
# than quietly re-coupling the image to a folder that is going away.
**
!rle/
!rle/requirements.txt
!rle/__init__.py
!rle/server/
!rle/server/*.py
!rle/server/vendor/
!rle/server/vendor/*.py
!rle/server/vendor/task-meta/
!rle/server/vendor/task-meta/*.json.gz
